4.96.m:
Uddhava said:
"Alone a living being comes into the world, and alone he departs again and again;
a person experiences the fruits of his own actions in accordance with karma. // 6

4.97.m:
Rādhikā said:
May your path be auspicious; may there always be welfare for you;
attain knowledge from the abode of Hari; be dearly beloved of Kṛṣṇa.
